#: core/dplugins/bqm/convert/converttoheif/converttoheifplugin.cpp:62
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>This Batch Queue Manager tool can convert images data to HEIF format.</"
#| "p><p>High Efficiency Image File Format (HEIF), also known as High "
#| "Efficiency Image Coding (HEIC), is a file format for individual images "
#| "and image sequences. It was developed by the Moving Picture Experts Group "
#| "(MPEG) and it claims that twice as much information can be stored in a "
#| "HEIF image as in a JPEG image of the same size, resulting in a better "
#| "quality image. HEIF also supports animation, and is capable of storing "
#| "more information than an animated GIF at a small fraction of the size.</"
#| "p><p>See <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
#| "High_Efficiency_Image_File_Format'>High Efficiency Image File Format</a> "
#| "for details.</p>"
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>This Batch Queue Manager tool can convert images data to HEIF format.</"
"para><para>High Efficiency Image File Format (HEIF), also known as High "
"Efficiency Image Coding (HEIC), is a file format for individual images and "
"image sequences. It was developed by the Moving Picture Experts Group (MPEG) "
"and it claims that twice as much information can be stored in a HEIF image "
"as in a JPEG image of the same size, resulting in a better quality image. "
"HEIF also supports animation, and is capable of storing more information "
"than an animated GIF at a small fraction of the size.</para><para>See <link "
"url='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_Efficiency_Image_File_Format'>High "
"Efficiency Image File Format</link> for details.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<p>이 일괄 작업 대기열 관리자 도구로 이미지 데이터를 HEIF 형식으로 변환할 수 "
"있습니다.</p><p>HEIF(고효율 이미지 파일 형식) 또는 HEIC(고효율 이미지 코딩)"
"는 단일 이미지와 이미지 시퀀스를 저장할 수 있는 파일 형식입니다. MPEG에서 개"
"발했고 같은 크기의 JPEG 이미지에 비해서 두 배의 정보를 담을 수 있다고 주장합"
"니다. HEIF는 애니메이션을 지원하며, 같은 정보를 애니메이션 GIF보다 더 효율적"
"으로 저장할 수 있습니다.</p><p>형식에 대해서 더 자세히 알아 보려면 <a "
"href='https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/고효율_이미지_파일_포맷'>고효율 이미지 파"
"일 포맷</a> 페이지를 참조하십시오."

#: core/dplugins/bqm/convert/converttojp2/converttojp2plugin.cpp:42
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid "Convert To JP2"
