#: core/dplugins/dimg/heif/dimgheifplugin.cpp:84
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>This plugin permit to load and save image using Libheif codec.</"
#| "p><p>High Efficiency Image File Format (HEIF), also known as High "
#| "Efficiency Image Coding (HEIC), is a file format for individual images "
#| "and image sequences. It was developed by the Moving Picture Experts Group "
#| "(MPEG) and it claims that twice as much information can be stored in a "
#| "HEIF image as in a JPEG image of the same size, resulting in a better "
#| "quality image. HEIF also supports animation, and is capable of storing "
#| "more information than an animated GIF at a small fraction of the size.</"
#| "p><p>Encoding HEIC is relevant of optional libde265 codec. %1</p><p>See "
